Keep exactly ONE item in_progress at a time; use the kanban
board for cross-session work. See ``describe_tool("todo")``
for the full contract.<|"|>,parameters:{properties:{merge:{type:<|"|>BOOLEAN<|"|>},todos:{nullable:true,items:{additionalProperties:true,properties:{},type:<|"|>OBJECT<|"|>},type:<|"|>ARRAY<|"|>}},type:<|"|>OBJECT<|"|>}}<tool|><|tool>declaration:computer_do{description:<|"|>Run a plan (string or list of action dicts) through the
