this for anything about the present moment. Optional IANA
timezone (e.g. 'Asia/Shanghai').<|"|>,parameters:{properties:{timezone:{nullable:true,type:<|"|>STRING<|"|>}},type:<|"|>OBJECT<|"|>}}<tool|><|tool>declaration:calculate{description:<|"|>Evaluate a safe arithmetic expression. Supports + - * / ** % //
